tent": "Example: Wow, your grandmother is 93 years old?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le01ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking and Saying Someone's Age", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to ask someone's age, you use the question  <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cHow old are you?\u201d </span>  <br />You can answer with the phrase <span class=\"italic\"> \u201cI am _____ years old.\u201d </span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Annie </span>: How old are your grandparents? <br /> <span class=\"strong\"> Bryan</span>: They are 85 and 86 years old.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Charlie</span>:  How old are you?<br /> <span class=\"strong\"> Rose</span>:  I am 25 years old.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Shannon</span>: How old is he? <br /> <span class=\"strong\"> Tim</span>: He is 16 years old.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Completing a Simple Personal Information Form", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Use this information in a simple form: <br/> First Name<br/> Last Name<br/> Age<br/> Country<br/> Family Member", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">First Name: Naomi <br/> Last Name: Tanaka<br/> Age: 102 years old <br/>Country: Japan <br/>Family Member: Rieko Tanaka</span>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use basic information in simple situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Completes a simple personal information form. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts a